(66,	0,	1,	19,	'IT-sikkerhed',	'Supportløsninger',	'On-premises og hybride serverløsninger skræddersyet lige netop til jeres unikke behov. Windows og Linux serverplatforme med automatiseret og proaktiv monitorering.',	'On-premises og hybride serverløsninger skræddersyet lige netop til jeres unikke behov.',	NULL,	'it-infrastructure',	'On-premises og hybride serverløsninger',	'images/uploaded_icons/image_67cef5d4819b04.91086071.svg',	'<div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iqzf\" data-gjs-type=\"default\" class=\"section-new\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"i5l6\" class=\"container\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"itxx\" class=\"row\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"idd6\" data-gjs-type=\"default\" class=\"col-12 col-lg-8\"><p data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"isgi\" class=\"h1 mb-4\">Protect users and endpoints</p><p data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iyxdv\" data-gjs-type=\"text\">Secure your end points to detect. respond to, and recover from user security threat like ransomeware, phising, and malware. Secure the endpoints before threat compromise your business&nbsp;</p><p data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iz2qq\">Secure your end points to detect. respond to, and recover from user security threat like ransomeware, phising, and malware. Secure the endpoints before threat compromise your business&nbsp;</p><p data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"i0bwi\">Secure your end points to detect. respond to, and recover from user security threat like ransomeware, phising, and malware. Secure the endpoints before threat compromise your business&nbsp;</p></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"igb3\" class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\"></div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"c13466\" data-gjs-type=\"default\" class=\"section-two\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"container\"><p data-highlightable=\"1\" data-gjs-type=\"text\" class=\"h2 text-center mb-5\">Empowe user to work the way they want</p><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"row\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"ii0ji\