v></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3 mb-lg-0 mb-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body text-center\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"igqall\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_6805ef116394c8.77814141.svg\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"idhddy\" class=\"object-position-center\"></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4\">Remote workforce\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-text mb-4\">Improve connectivity to create ideal experiences for remote teams.\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Power remote work\n              </div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body text-center\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iuj3n8\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_6805ef147a37a4.74319885.svg\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"inp3w8\" class=\"object-position-center\"></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4\">Safe environments\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-text mb-4\">Unite physical and cybersecurity to protect what matters.\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Secure your spaces\n              </div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body text-center\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"idh7da\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_6805ef16cfffd4.46615836.svg\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"iy6h9s\" class=\"object-position-center\"></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4\">Smart spaces\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-text mb-4\">Elevate the places where employees and customers come together.\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Optimize your spaces\n              </div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"i1prqr\" class=\"py-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iqaeg2\" class=\"container\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"row row-new gx-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-center h2 mb-5\">Upcoming Events\n          </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card mx-auto border-primary border-start border-0 border-5 shadow mb-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-muted\">25, April, 2025\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4 mb-5\">LigoWave PTMP / DLB Certification&nbsp;\n                <span id=\"i3upl3\">Training</span></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a slot\n              </div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0 mx-auto border-5 border-start border-danger shadow\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-muted\">28, April, 2025\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4 mb-5\">Infinity WiFi Certification&nbsp;\n                <span id=\"i0bmmu\">Training</span></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a slot\n              </div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-center h2 mb-5\">News and Press\n          </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0 mx-auto border-5 border-start border-success shadow mb-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-muted\">26, June, 2019\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4 mb-5\">Technical support on an hourly&nbsp;\n                <span draggable=\"true\" id=\"iewm9y-2\">basis</span></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Read More\n              </div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card border-0 mb-4 mx-auto border-5 border-start border-warning shadow\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-body\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-muted\">20, Nov, 2019\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"card-title h4 mb-5\">Cloud Router and LigoWave strengthen collaboration\n              </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Read More\n              </div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iqm5\" class=\"bg-white\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iul9\" class=\"container\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-center h2\">Pick out our dealers\n      </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"text-center mb-5\">Cloud Router establishes a value-adding collaboration - creating sustainable relationships.\n      </div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"row row-new mb-4 px-lg-5 g-5\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"ipttd\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" id=\"iegw3\" class=\"ratio ratio-1x1 w-100\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_680240a1c614f8.47039467.png\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"iw86p\"></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"ratio ratio-1x1 w-100\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_680240a4790bf2.11925863.png\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"ik895f\"></div></div><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"ratio ratio-1x1 w-100\"><img src=\"https://shankar.sitecare.org/images/pageBuilder/image_680240a6404bb5.24926567.png\" alt=\"Image\" id=\"i27tzw\"></div></